    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58008" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλοτοπ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>deal subtly, spin out time by false pretences</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ γὰρ χρὴ κλοτοπεύειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					19.149
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. περὶ τὸ νησίδιον</span>,
			perh. to be read for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλοπεύω</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				1.30
			</span></i>:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλοτοπ-ευτής:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαλλάκτης, ἀλαζών</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
